  (text "Power & I/O  —  USB‖external 5V OR-ing, AP2112 +3V3 source, separate laser supply, on-board AD7606-4 ADC, monitor-PD front end" (at 36 16 0) (effects (font (size 2.2 2.2)) (justify left)) (uuid c1d2e3f4-6000-4000-a000-000000001349))
  (text "J6 = ext +5V in;  USB VBUS (from MCU J1) ‖ J6 OR-ed via SS14 Schottkys (D5/D6) → +5V; U11 AP2112K-3.3 → +3V3." (at 36 22 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid c1d2e3f4-6000-4000-a000-000000001350))
  (text "U14 AD7606BSTZ-4 digitizes VOUT1..4 on-board; ESP32 drives CONVST/SCLK/CS/RESET and reads BUSY + DOUTA/DOUTB." (at 36 28 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid c1d2e3f4-6000-4000-a000-000000001351))
  (text "MPD_RAWx -> 750R sense to MPD_BIAS; INA4180A1 gain=20 -> 1k/100nF -> MPDx ESP32 ADC." (at 36 34 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid c1d2e3f4-6000-4000-a000-000000001352))
  (text "LM4040C50 holds LASER_V+ - MPD_BIAS near 5V; PLT5 typ 150uA -> about 2.25V ADC and about 4.89V monitor-PD reverse bias." (at 36 40 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid c1d2e3f4-6000-4000-a000-000000001353))
  (text "ISENSE headroom: keep I_laser <= 250 mA so V_sense (=I*10ohm) stays inside the ESP32 ADC range with margin." (at 36 46 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left)) (uuid c1d2e3f4-6000-4000-a000-000000001354))
